    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d139">

                <pb facs="0156" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg82"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 25, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to previous correspondence
                    with the lieutenant governor of New Brunswick on the subject of the Chesapeake,
                    I have the honor to enclose copy of a despatch of the 18th instant, which I have
                    received from Mr. Gordon, transmitting copy of a report, made to his excellency
                    by the high sheriff of St. John’s, as to the steps taken by him to secure the
                    apprehension of the captors of this vessel.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>




                <xi:include href="d139-a1.xml" xpointer="d139-a1"/>
